      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, just figured out why. `makeVarsSingleton` (which collects all `MakeVars` contributions) is [registered later than other singletons](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/android/register.go;l\u003d199;drc\u003dfc7a41126db7147c5b6863fe43ce552ece62bf57), so it\u0027s guaranteed that its `GenerateBuildActions` is run later than those of other singletons. So maybe we should do the same for `androidMkSingleton`? WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "f79556fb_1db2a3ab",
      "revId": "de6dfdeaeacdada13a4cf2ac3a8b19cb595256dc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
